{"4002300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goblin Mode", "steam_appid": 4002300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a peaceful day in the human kingdom...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then you showed up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblin Mode</strong> is a first-person stealth-chaos sandbox where you play as a mischievous little goblin unleashed upon a world of greedy humans, fragile settlements, and extremely stealable treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through forts, villages, and castles, causing mayhem however you please. Pick pockets, trigger traps, smash valuables, bite supplies, prank guards, and escape with sacks of loot before the whole kingdom comes hunting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cause enough chaos to unlock the exit... then decide whether to flee rich, or stay for one more terrible idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/dc10b0918dd19ed699fc1c3da65cb703.poster.avif?t=1777314277\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/dc10b0918dd19ed699fc1c3da65cb703.webm?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/dc10b0918dd19ed699fc1c3da65cb703.mp4?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Strike from the shadows, outsmart guards, and cause glorious Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/e749502cd8c1cba675763f662823c8c3.poster.avif?t=1777314277\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/e749502cd8c1cba675763f662823c8c3.webm?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/e749502cd8c1cba675763f662823c8c3.mp4?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gold, relics, valuables, food - if the humans wanted to keep it, they should have defended it better</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/c27d85d23619f2447e9f0fb69401d418.poster.avif?t=1777314277\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/c27d85d23619f2447e9f0fb69401d418.webm?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/c27d85d23619f2447e9f0fb69401d418.mp4?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chomp supplies, wreck furniture, destroy weaponry, and reduce carefully built settlements to rubble</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/73215ed9ec9ac0d3e382635506750b8d.poster.avif?t=1777314277\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/73215ed9ec9ac0d3e382635506750b8d.webm?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/73215ed9ec9ac0d3e382635506750b8d.mp4?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Chain together pranks, destruction, humiliations, thefts, and escapes to build crazy, chaotic combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/edc9bcab22e5c0fe412035f9a05e840b.poster.avif?t=1777314277\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/edc9bcab22e5c0fe412035f9a05e840b.webm?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/edc9bcab22e5c0fe412035f9a05e840b.mp4?t=1777314277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Reach the exit and bank your rewards, or risk everything by staying longer for a bigger payday</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Early Access Includes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Weeping Willows (Human Fort)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large replayable sandbox level packed with guards, secrets, shortcuts, traps, treasure, and one deeply unfortunate Champion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Challenge Days</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day I:</strong> Free Chaos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day II:</strong> Mischief Tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day III:</strong> Champion Prank Challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horrible little goblin (you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person stealth-chaos sandbox gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven destruction and chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools, traps, gadgets, and goblin trickery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic guards that search, chase, and adapt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo scoring built for stylish mayhem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple approaches, routes, and replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom has it coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/a0abbe65faa806a00167085ef92b0f96.avif?t=1777314277\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was a peaceful day in the human kingdom...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then you showed up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblin Mode</strong> is a first-person stealth-chaos sandbox where you play as a mischievous little goblin unleashed upon a world of greedy humans, fragile settlements, and extremely stealable treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through forts, villages, and castles, causing mayhem however you please. Pick pockets, trigger traps, smash valuables, bite supplies, prank guards, and escape with sacks of loot before the whole kingdom comes hunting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cause enough chaos to unlock the exit... then decide whether to flee rich, or stay for one more terrible idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002300/extras/dc10b0918dd19ed699fc1c3da65cb703.poster.avif?t=1777314277\" width=1